type: software
title: "insurance-soc-lab"
abstract: >-
  A one-command SOC lab for a fictional insurer (InsurCo): a Wazuh 4.14.9 SIEM, monitored
  hosts, a telemetry and attack simulator, custom detection rules tested against the real
  Wazuh engine in CI, Sigma ports, runbooks, alert routing and active response.
